{"unit_id":"hahavguoqu__dsh-genshin-launch#card-zh","repo":"hahavguoqu/dsh-genshin-launch","commit":"e7b2194d8eb8c590e124c1b227c438723224feb3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-genshin-launch 是面向 Windows DSH 宿主的原神启动插件，在对话输入框右侧加入启动按钮和设置菜单。插件先检查已保存或配置的游戏路径，再结合 Windows 安装信息、快捷方式、固定磁盘常见目录和启动器配置查找 YuanShen.exe；也可由用户打开文件选择窗口指定游戏程序。找到游戏后可通过按用户隔离的 Windows 计划任务启动，首次设置需管理员确认。设置菜单还可更换位置；未安装时可打开原神官网。路径保存在本机用户配置中，不需要 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:65-71","lib/controller.js:26-88","lib/discovery.js:10-60","lib/preferences.js:6-19"]}
{"unit_id":"hahavguoqu__dsh-genshin-launch#card-en","repo":"hahavguoqu/dsh-genshin-launch","commit":"e7b2194d8eb8c590e124c1b227c438723224feb3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-genshin-launch adds a game button to the DSH input bar on Windows. It finds or lets users select YuanShen.exe, then launches it through a per-user scheduled task after initial administrator approval. A settings menu changes the saved game path or opens the official site. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:65-71","lib/controller.js:26-88","lib/discovery.js:10-60","lib/preferences.js:6-19"]}
