{"unit_id":"hahavguoqu__dsh-genshin-launch#feature-1","repo":"hahavguoqu/dsh-genshin-launch","commit":"e7b2194d8eb8c590e124c1b227c438723224feb3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-genshin-launch 的功能「自动查找游戏」：点击启动或打开设置时，插件检查保存路径、已有任务路径和 Windows 安装线索，定位有效的 YuanShen.exe。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/discovery.js:10-60"]}
