{"unit_id":"hahavguoqu__dsh-genshin-launch#feature-3","repo":"hahavguoqu/dsh-genshin-launch","commit":"e7b2194d8eb8c590e124c1b227c438723224feb3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-genshin-launch 的功能「免重复确认启动」：首次设置后，启动按钮通过 Windows 计划任务启动选定的原神程序；每次点击由任务处理启动请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/launcher.js:12-36"]}
