{"unit_id":"hahavguoqu__dsh-genshin-launch#caveat-1","repo":"hahavguoqu/dsh-genshin-launch","commit":"e7b2194d8eb8c590e124c1b227c438723224feb3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-genshin-launch 使用前须知：首次配置免确认启动会弹出 Windows 管理员授权，并创建当前用户专用的按需计划任务。（见 setup-task.ps1:39-80）","source":"generated","evidence":["setup-task.ps1:39-80"]}
{"unit_id":"hahavguoqu__dsh-genshin-launch#caveat-2","repo":"hahavguoqu/dsh-genshin-launch","commit":"e7b2194d8eb8c590e124c1b227c438723224feb3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-genshin-launch 使用前须知：所选游戏路径写入当前用户的 LOCALAPPDATA 配置文件；游戏和原生选择窗口在运行 DSH 的 Windows 主机上打开。（见 lib/preferences.js:311-324）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/preferences.js:6-19"]}
